---
layout: kinship
title: 'Family Trees & Kinship Network'
description: 'Interactive multi-generational family trees reconstructed from St Peter’s parish registers, 1841–1921 censuses, wills, monumental inscriptions, and manorial records.'
tags: [post, church, history]
ancestorCrumb1Source: { label: 'Parish Records', url: '/history/parish-records/' }
---

<div
  id="kinship-app"
  class="kinship-app"
  data-kinship-url="/assets/ilmer-kinship.json"
>
  <div class="kinship-toolbar">
    <div class="kinship-toolbar-row">
      <div class="kinship-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Kinship diagram view">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="tab-village"
          class="kinship-tab"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="true"
          data-view="village"
        >
          Village Kinship Web (1747–1973)
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="tab-manor"
          class="kinship-tab"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-view="manor"
        >
          Manorial Dynasties (1338–1912)
        </button>
        <button
          type="button"
          id="tab-custom"
          class="kinship-tab"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          data-view="custom"
          hidden
        >
          Loaded GEDCOM
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="kinship-actions">
        <button
          type="button"
          id="btn-bridges"
          class="kinship-btn"
          aria-pressed="false"
          title="Highlight marriages linking different Ilmer families"
        >
          <span class="kinship-dot kinship-dot--bridge" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          Intermarriages
        </button>

        <div class="kinship-search">
          <label class="kinship-file-input" for="kinship-search-input">Find person, farm, or event</label>
          <input
            id="kinship-search-input"
            class="kinship-search-input"
            type="search"
            placeholder="Find person, farm, or event…"
            autocomplete="off"
          >
          <div id="kinship-search-results" class="kinship-search-results" hidden></div>
        </div>

        <div class="kinship-zoom-group" role="group" aria-label="Zoom controls">
          <button type="button" id="btn-zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">&minus;</button>
          <span id="zoom-readout" class="kinship-zoom-readout">100%</span>
          <button type="button" id="btn-zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button>
          <button type="button" id="btn-fit">Fit</button>
        </div>

        <button type="button" id="btn-fullscreen" class="kinship-btn" aria-pressed="false">
          Fullscreen
        </button>

        <a
          class="kinship-btn"
          href="/assets/ilmer-kinship.ged"
          download="ilmer-kinship.ged"
          title="Download standards-compliant GEDCOM 7.0 file for Gramps, Ancestry, FamilySearch or RootsMagic"
        >
          Download .ged
        </a>

        <label class="kinship-btn" for="gedcom-upload" title="Preview any local GEDCOM (.ged) file in this explorer">
          Open .ged
          <input id="gedcom-upload" class="kinship-file-input" type="file" accept=".ged,.gedcom,text/plain">
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="family-filters" class="kinship-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter by family"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="kinship-stage">
    <div id="kinship-canvas-wrap" class="kinship-canvas-wrap">
      <div id="kinship-loading" class="kinship-loading" role="status">Loading Ilmer kinship archive…</div>

      <svg id="kinship-svg" class="kinship-svg" role="img" aria-label="Interactive Ilmer family tree diagram">
        <defs>
          <pattern id="kinship-dot-grid" width="32" height="32" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
            <circle cx="1.5" cy="1.5" r="1" fill="#cbbda0" opacity="0.45"></circle>
          </pattern>
        </defs>
        <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#kinship-dot-grid)"></rect>
        <g id="kinship-viewport">
          <g id="layer-bands"></g>
          <g id="layer-headers"></g>
          <g id="layer-edges"></g>
          <g id="layer-unions"></g>
          <g id="layer-nodes"></g>
          <g id="layer-bridge-pills"></g>
        </g>
      </svg>

      <div id="selection-banner" class="kinship-banner" hidden aria-live="polite">
        <span id="selection-banner-text"></span>
        <button type="button" id="btn-clear-selection">Show all</button>
      </div>

      <div class="kinship-hint">
        Drag to pan &middot; Scroll to zoom &middot; Click any person to trace ancestors &amp; descendants
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside id="dossier-drawer" class="kinship-drawer" aria-label="Person details" hidden>
      <div class="kinship-drawer-head">
        <div>
          <div id="d-family-badge" class="kinship-drawer-family"></div>
          <h2 id="d-name"></h2>
          <p id="d-dates" class="kinship-drawer-dates"></p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="btn-close-drawer" class="kinship-close-btn" aria-label="Close details">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <div id="d-body" class="kinship-drawer-body"></div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="kinship-legend">
    <div class="kinship-legend-group">
      <span class="kinship-legend-item">
        <svg width="24" height="10" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="0" y1="5" x2="24" y2="5" stroke="#5c5346" stroke-width="1.8"></line></svg>
        Verified parent &rarr; child
      </span>
      <span class="kinship-legend-item">
        <svg width="24" height="10" aria-hidden="true">
          <line x1="0" y1="5" x2="24" y2="5" stroke="#b3541a" stroke-width="2.4"></line>
          <circle cx="12" cy="5" r="3" fill="#b3541a"></circle>
        </svg>
        Cross-family intermarriage bridge
      </span>
      <span class="kinship-legend-item">
        <svg width="24" height="10" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="0" y1="5" x2="24" y2="5" stroke="#5c5346" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="4 3"></line></svg>
        Likely / indirect link (explained in dossier)
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="kinship-legend-group">
      <span>&#x1F4DC; Transcribed will</span>
      <span>&#x1FAA6; Memorial inscription</span>
      <span>&#x271D; War dead</span>
      <span>&#x2302; Key Ilmer property</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="kinship-prose">
  <h2>Sources &amp; Open Genealogy Data</h2>
  <p>
    Every verified link in this diagram is cross-referenced from the primary sources published on this site: the
    <a href="/history/st-peters-baptisms/">baptism</a>, <a href="/history/st-peters-marriages/">marriage</a>, and
    <a href="/history/st-peters-burials/">burial</a> registers of St Peter’s, the
    <a href="/census/">1841–1921 census returns</a> (including <a href="/history/lockington/">Lockington</a>),
    <a href="/wills/">transcribed wills</a>, <a href="/history/monumental-inscriptions/">monumental inscriptions</a>,
    and the <a href="/history/timeline/">village timeline</a>. Click any card above to open its dossier with direct
    links to the supporting pages.
  </p>
  <p>
    Where St Peter’s registers have historical gaps (notably the 1640–1659 Civil War and Commonwealth period) or where
    an event occurred in a neighbouring parish such as Bledlow, Longwick, or Towersey, inferred or indirect bridges are
    drawn as dashed lines rather than solid descents.
  </p>
  <p>
    The underlying dataset is published in two open formats: as a
    <a href="/assets/ilmer-kinship.ged" download="ilmer-kinship.ged">standard GEDCOM 7.0 file (<code>ilmer-kinship.ged</code>)</a>
    ready to import into Gramps, RootsMagic, FamilySearch, or Ancestry, and as structured
    <a href="/assets/ilmer-kinship.json">JSON (<code>ilmer-kinship.json</code>)</a> validated against its JSON Schema on
    every build. You can also use <strong>Open .ged</strong> above to load and explore any local GEDCOM file directly in
    your browser.
  </p>
</section>

<script type="module" src="{{ '/assets/js/kinship-tree.js' | cacheBust }}"></script>
